# pnpm's supportedArchitectures selects only ONE (os, cpu) triplet per install
# (the first non-"current" entry wins; the rest are ignored), so no single
# install carries both darwin-x64 and darwin-arm64 natives. prepare-runtime.mjs
# handles multi-arch by deploying the harness closure once per target with the
# target's platform/arch pinned via --config.supportedArchitectures.*, then
# merging the closures. This file intentionally sets nothing that would pin
# optional deps to a single triplet during the repo-wide install.